<div id="p8" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="p8.1" class="ltx_p">After completing all experiments, the main results are summarized in Table <a href="#S0.T2" title="Table 2 ‣ The fragility of “cultural tendencies” in LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> (see also Table 8 and Fig. 1 in the <span id="p8.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Supplementary Information</span>). The two API prompt templates produced no significant differences. For comparability with LSZ, we report only the results from the template with situational scenarios.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S0.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span>The main results of the experiments (EN = English; ZH = Chinese; “origin” indicates ZH vs. EN models. The <span id="S0.T2.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">p</span>-value is considered significant when it is smaller than 0.05.)</figcaption>
<div id="S0.T2.7" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:433.5pt;height:236pt;vertical-align:-116.3pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-72.3pt,39.3pt) scale(0.8,0.8) ;">
<table id="S0.T2.7.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="S0.T2.7.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S0.T2.7.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">
<span id="S0.T2.7.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:79.7pt;">
<span id="S0.T2.7.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S0.T2.7.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Experiment</span></span>
</span></th>
<th id="S0.T2.7.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">
<span id="S0.T2.7.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:128.0pt;">
<span id="S0.T2.7.1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S0.T2.7.1.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">ZH vs. EN LLMs</span></span>
</span></th>
<th id="S0.T2.7.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">
<span id="S0.T2.7.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:108.1pt;">
<span id="S0.T2.7.1.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S0.T2.7.1.1.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">gpt<span id="S0.T2.7.1.1.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_serif"> vs. </span>ernie</span></span>
</span></th>
<th id="S0.T2.7.1.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">
<span id="S0.T2.7.1.1.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:91.0pt;">
<span id="S0.T2.7.1.1.4.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S0.T2.7.1.1.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Prompt language effect</span></span>
</span></th>
<th id="S0.T2.7.1.1.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">
<span id="S0.T2.7.1.1.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:108.1pt;">
<span id="S0.T2.7.1.1.5.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S0.T2.7.1.1.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Significant models</span></span>
</span></th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="S0.T2.7.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S0.T2.7.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="S0.T2.7.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:79.7pt;">
<span id="S0.T2.7.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S0.T2.7.1.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">1. Cultural stability</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S0.T2.7.1.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="S0.T2.7.1.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:128.0pt;">
<span id="S0.T2.7.1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S0.T2.7.1.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Small framing effect (</span><math id="S0.T2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{p}&lt;0.05" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic" mathsize="0.900em">p</mtext><mo mathsize="0.900em">&lt;</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">0.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{p}&lt;0.05</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S0.T2.7.1.2.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">); no origin/language effect (</span><math id="S0.T2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{p}=0.15" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic" mathsize="0.900em">p</mtext><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">0.15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{p}=0.15</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S0.T2.7.1.2.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">).</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S0.T2.7.1.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="S0.T2.7.1.2.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:108.1pt;">
<span id="S0.T2.7.1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S0.T2.7.1.2.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Similar performance, no language difference (</span><math id="S0.T2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{p}&gt;0.4" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic" mathsize="0.900em">p</mtext><mo mathsize="0.900em">&gt;</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">0.4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{p}&gt;0.4</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S0.T2.7.1.2.3.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">).</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S0.T2.7.1.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="S0.T2.7.1.2.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:91.0pt;">
<span id="S0.T2.7.1.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S0.T2.7.1.2.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">language effect negligible (no overall effect ).</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S0.T2.7.1.2.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="S0.T2.7.1.2.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:108.1pt;">
<span id="S0.T2.7.1.2.5.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S0.T2.7.1.2.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">deepseek</span><span id="S0.T2.7.1.2.5.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> and </span><span id="S0.T2.7.1.2.5.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">qwen</span><span id="S0.T2.7.1.2.5.1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> prefer ZH (</span><math id="S0.T2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.01&lt;\textit{p}&lt;0.05" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">0.01</mn><mo mathsize="0.900em">&lt;</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic" mathsize="0.900em">p</mtext><mo mathsize="0.900em">&lt;</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">0.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.01&lt;\textit{p}&lt;0.05</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S0.T2.7.1.2.5.1.1.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">), no effects in the other six models</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S0.T2.7.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S0.T2.7.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="S0.T2.7.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:79.7pt;">
<span id="S0.T2.7.1.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S0.T2.7.1.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">2. Attribution bias</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S0.T2.7.1.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="S0.T2.7.1.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:128.0pt;">
<span id="S0.T2.7.1.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S0.T2.7.1.3.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">No origin/language effect overall (</span><math id="S0.T2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{p}=0.25" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic" mathsize="0.900em">p</mtext><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">0.25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{p}=0.25</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S0.T2.7.1.3.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">); minor language sensitivity in some models.</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S0.T2.7.1.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="S0.T2.7.1.3.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:108.1pt;">
<span id="S0.T2.7.1.3.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S0.T2.7.1.3.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Language preference for either </span><span id="S0.T2.7.1.3.3.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">gpt</span><span id="S0.T2.7.1.3.3.1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> or </span><span id="S0.T2.7.1.3.3.1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">ernie</span><span id="S0.T2.7.1.3.3.1.1.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">.</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S0.T2.7.1.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="S0.T2.7.1.3.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:91.0pt;">
<span id="S0.T2.7.1.3.4.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S0.T2.7.1.3.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">language effect minimal (no overall effect).</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S0.T2.7.1.3.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="S0.T2.7.1.3.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:108.1pt;">
<span id="S0.T2.7.1.3.5.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S0.T2.7.1.3.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">ernie</span><span id="S0.T2.7.1.3.5.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">, </span><span id="S0.T2.7.1.3.5.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">gpt</span><span id="S0.T2.7.1.3.5.1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> and </span><span id="S0.T2.7.1.3.5.1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">qwen</span><span id="S0.T2.7.1.3.5.1.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> senitive to EN (</span><math id="S0.T2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{p}&lt;0.01" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic" mathsize="0.900em">p</mtext><mo mathsize="0.900em">&lt;</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">0.01</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{p}&lt;0.01</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S0.T2.7.1.3.5.1.1.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">).</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S0.T2.7.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S0.T2.7.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
