</span></td>
<td id="A3.T4.2.1.9.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T4.2.1.9.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:103.5pt;">
<span id="A3.T4.2.1.9.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">4–12 items</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T4.2.1.9.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T4.2.1.9.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:103.5pt;">
<span id="A3.T4.2.1.9.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">30–60 items per condition (30–60 total per language)</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T4.2.1.10" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T4.2.1.10.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T4.2.1.10.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:96.6pt;">
<span id="A3.T4.2.1.10.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T4.2.1.10.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Response reason</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T4.2.1.10.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T4.2.1.10.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:103.5pt;">
<span id="A3.T4.2.1.10.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">No requirements</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T4.2.1.10.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T4.2.1.10.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:103.5pt;">
<span id="A3.T4.2.1.10.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Explicitly requiring models to provide justifications for their responses, encouraging more deliberate and thoughtful outputs</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T4.2.1.11" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T4.2.1.11.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T4.2.1.11.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:96.6pt;">
<span id="A3.T4.2.1.11.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T4.2.1.11.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Statistical methods</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T4.2.1.11.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T4.2.1.11.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:103.5pt;">
<span id="A3.T4.2.1.11.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Two-sided <math id="A3.T4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math>-tests + Chi-square test</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T4.2.1.11.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T4.2.1.11.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:103.5pt;">
<span id="A3.T4.2.1.11.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A3.T4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math>-tests + Wilcoxon tests + ANOVA + effect sizes + item-level and logic regression etc.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T4.2.1.12" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T4.2.1.12.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T4.2.1.12.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:96.6pt;">
<span id="A3.T4.2.1.12.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T4.2.1.12.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Replication type</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T4.2.1.12.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T4.2.1.12.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:103.5pt;">
<span id="A3.T4.2.1.12.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Original stimuli (unpublished for some tasks)</span>
</span></td>
