<span id="A4.T9.2.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Prompt language <span id="A4.T9.2.1.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">does not significantly influence overall LLM performance</span> (Mean difference = -0.004, <math id="A4.T9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p=0.917" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.917</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p=0.917</annotation></semantics></math>, Cohen’s <math id="A4.T9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d=-0.004" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>0.004</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d=-0.004</annotation></semantics></math>). Only <span id="A4.T9.2.1.2.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">two models</span> show statistically significant language effects (Kimi and gpt).</span>
